{{Quote|Radiates an aura of destruction. Interesting shape for a sword.|Item}}
'''Bisento''' is a {{Legendary}} [[sword]].

Despite being a [[First Sea]] sword, it has quick and extremely high damaging moves, being able to dish out some of the highest burst damage one can achieve with a sword. Said damage and quick attacks allow Bisento to compete with many popular [[Second Sea]] and [[Third Sea]] swords, making this an excellent choice in PvP if the user can predict and aim well. 

However, Bisento suffers major drawbacks if the user fights in the air with it due to its noticeably smaller hitboxes (especially on {{Ability|X}}) compared to newer, more well known swords.

It is also indubitably the strongest sword in the [[First Sea]], being useful in all seas. It is also the most expensive sword in said area, costing{{Money|1,000,000}}.

==Obtainment==
To obtain the Bisento, the player must buy it from the [[Master Sword Dealer]], who is located on the fourth island at [[Skylands]]. The player can buy this sword for {{Money|1,000,000}} if the player is at least Lv. 250.

===Version 2===
The player must have the Bisento in their [[Inventory]]. Afterwards, the player must defeat [[Greybeard]] at [[Marine Fortress]]. A message saying "Something weird has occurred to your <Bisento>..." will appear after defeating [[Greybeard]]. 

The appearance of the Bisento itself will not change, and neither will the name of the two moves. However, the moves will look different and deal more damage.

